u mono ga aruComment: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:01.89,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Hi ga noboriComment: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:06.96,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kanashimi sae hitoshiku terasuComment: 0,0:02:06.99,0:02:09.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,ShinjiterundaComment: 0,0:02:09.46,0:02:15.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Itsuka hitotsu ni tsunagaru mirai woComment: 0,0:02:15.82,0:02:19.50,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Issho ni mitsuke ni ikouComment: 0,0:02:19.52,0:02:23.69,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kimi no kawari wa inaiComment: 0,0:02:23.87,0:02:25.53,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,WasurenaideComment: 0,0:02:25.63,0:02:27.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,We fight togetherDialogue: 0,0:02:36.45,0:02:38.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Run, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.90,0:02:46.93,Main,,0,0,0,,No... No way!Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.53,0:02:49.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.92,0:02:51.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain, there's no chance!Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:55.20,Title,,0,0,240,,Sabo's SeaDialogue: 0,0:02:51.79,0:02:53.54,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way to put out the fire!Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:57.12,Main,,0,0,0,,We gotta give up the ship! We can't flee to the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:03:00.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn the King! How could he do this to us?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.93,0:03:03.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll show that bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.40,0:03:07.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Honestly!Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.91,0:03:13.64,Main,,0,0,0,,It's so annoying that the sky in the south is bright even in the night.Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.64,0:03:17.38,Main,,0,0,0,,We are sorry, your Majesty. Let us close the curtain.Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.53,0:03:27.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Say, daddy, why are the people in the Gray Terminal not humans?Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.62,0:03:29.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do they have to get burned?Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.79,0:03:34.42,Main,,0,0,0,,As the phrase goes, "As a man sows, so shall he reap."Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:35.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Think about it.Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.66,0:03:40.97,Main,,0,0,0,,They could have avoided their fate just by being born nobles.Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:43.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Born nobles?Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.05,0:03:48.48,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right! They should have chosen to be born nobles!Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.17,0:03:50.44,Main,,0,0,0,,They're stupid!Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:55.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, enough about those people, you have to study for tomorrow.Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.02,0:03:56.55,Main,,0,0,0,,You better go to bed.Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:03:58.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.15,0:03:59.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Good night.Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:21.05,Main,,0,0,0,,--There's no way on this side! --We keep losing ground.Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:22.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna die here!Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.31,0:04:27.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder if those old men escaped safely.Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.91,0:04:30.48,Main,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be concerned about other people!Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:34.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! I don't even know where I am!Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.19,0:04:37.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Who said that you could get away, you brats?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.27,0:04:40.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Bluejam!Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.95,0:04:46.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you still here after setting the fire?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.07,0:04:48.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You were supposed to have escaped by now!Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.67,0:04:50.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you little shit!Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.37,0:04:54.11,Main,,0,0,0,,We're hopeless, you know.Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.17,0:04:57.58,Main,,0,0,0,,We have an unforeseen dilemma.Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:05:01.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Humans are strange creatures, aren't they?Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.14,0:05:06.82,Main,,0,0,0,,When you hit rock bottom, you can't stop laughing.Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.31,0:05:16.76,Main,,0,0,0,,They are acting weird.Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.65,0:05:18.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.66,0:05:20.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let them!Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.54,0:05:32.35,Main,,0,0,0,,We worked together - we're friends!Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:34.54,Main,,0,0,0,,We have to die together!Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:38.49,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't wanna die with you! Not in a million years!Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.49,0:05:40.15,Main,,0,0,0,,You're so cold.Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.15,0:05:45.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, you haven't told me where you keep your treasure.Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.37,0:05:51.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll save it for you before the fire gets it. So tell me where it is.Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.53,0:05:54.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Your life is in danger and all you care about is treasure?Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.73,0:05:58.18,Main,,0,0,0,,If you don't care, then tell me where it is.Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.66,0:06:02.84,Main,,0,0,0,,You've gone mad.Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:06.88,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're not gonna go get it, it'd be a waste.Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.88,0:06:12.05,Main,,0,0,0,,If nothing is done, it's gonna be reduced to charcoal like my ship.Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.05,0:06:14.22,Main,,0,0,0,,What a waste.Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.71,0:06:17.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous! That treasure is...Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.25,0:06:19.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, I tell you!Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.89,0:06:24.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace! You and Sabo spent a lot of time...Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:26.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo would understand!Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:29.09,Main,,0,0,0,,What matters the most now is your...Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:33.04,Main,,0,0,0,,What matters the most now is our lives!Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.70,0:06:41.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace...Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.49,0:06:53.83,Main,,0,0,0,,We keep our treasure from last six years in this tree.Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.83,0:06:55.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.78,0:06:58.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't cry!Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:07:01.71,Main,,0,0,0,,It's alright. This is not the end.Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.35,0:07:10.18,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?! I told you where it is!Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:13.03,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right. This is not the end.Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:17.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Which means you could be lying. You gotta come with us.Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:22.50,Main,,0,0,0,,No way! Then it's gonna be too late to escape!Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:23.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you guys go on your own?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:31.86,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't wanna mess with me now.Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.86,0:07:35.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm determined to make a come back,Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.40,0:07:37.63,Main,,0,0,0,,even if it means stealing from kidsDialogue: 0,0:07:37.63,0:07:40.88,Main,,0,0,0,,so I can take my revenge on nobles.Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.88,0:07:43.74,Main,,0,0,0,,And your brother is one of them.Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.74,0:07:47.58,Main,,0,0,0,,They think they're so specialDialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:51.85,Main,,0,0,0,,and look down on others as if we're trash!Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.85,0:07:54.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo doesn't think like that!Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.52,0:07:57.16,Main,,0,0,0,,He's the same as them, fool!Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.83,0:08:02.09,Main,,0,0,0,,He was with you both just to feel superior!Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.09,0:08:03.76,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not true!Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.41,0:08:06.74,Main,,0,0,0,,His parents are loaded.Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.74,0:08:09.20,Main,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have to worry about anything!Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.52,0:08:12.47,Main,,0,0,0,,It was just a pasttime for him.Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.47,0:08:15.63,Main,,0,0,0,,He was looking down on you guysDialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:17.28,Main,,0,0,0,,and laughing to himself holding his nose!Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.28,0:08:19.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop talking bad about Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:22.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Sabo just wants to be free!Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.22,0:08:26.02,Main,,0,0,0,,You little shit!Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.02,0:08:26.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.22,0:08:32.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you!Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.88,0:08:38.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.90,0:08:44.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't touch Luffy!!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.47,0:09:15.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! You okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:19.70,Main,,0,0,0,,What did you do?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:24.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit...Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:26.47,Main,,0,0,0,,You creepy brat!Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:30.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna make a fool out of me, too?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.01,0:09:32.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you scumbag!Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:35.39,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.27,0:09:38.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.40,0:09:40.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:53.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Dadan!Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.31,0:09:58.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you sea cretin!Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.81,0:10:03.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.94,0:10:16.46,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing here?Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:18.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Finally we found you!Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:22.87,Main,,0,0,0,,These are pretty serious wounds, Luffy! Are you okay?Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.56,0:10:25.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Dogra...Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.71,0:10:29.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't see Sabo anywhere!Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.61,0:10:33.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo went home. He's not here.Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.94,0:10:39.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:42.97,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the boss monkey from Mt. Corvo!Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:45.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the mountain bandit - Dadan!Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:49.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know why but I'm registered as their foster parent.Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.30,0:10:56.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright then...Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.96,0:11:03.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.48,0:11:05.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, boss!Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.86,0:11:08.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, what're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.91,0:11:11.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace, hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.53,0:11:12.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.29,0:11:14.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.94,0:11:18.56,Main,,0,0,0,,...won't run!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.19,0:11:24.43,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you saying, Ace?! Don't try to fight him!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.63,0:11:27.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Bluejam is a real villain!Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.57,0:11:31.24,Main,,0,0,0,,He's not a guy that a kid like you can beat!Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.24,0:11:34.82,Main,,0,0,0,,--L-Let me fight, too! --No, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:41.98,Main,,0,0,0,,You all, why don't you take Luffy and go ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:43.32,Main,,0,0,0,,B-Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:47.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take responsibility for bringing Ace home!Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.19,0:11:50.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.36,0:11:53.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Go!Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.73,0:11:56.48,Main,,0,0,0,,--Y-Yes, ma'am! --Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.48,0:12:00.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss! Come home safely!Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:06.57,Main,,0,0,0,,A woman and a child.Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.83,0:12:13.14,Main,,0,0,0,,If you overestimate your ability, you'll only get hurt!Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.82,0:12:18.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Only the strong and the cowardly survive in wars!Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.66,0:12:22.21,Main,,0,0,0,,The brave always die.Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.89,0:12:24.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that so?Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.58,0:12:26.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What a fool!Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.74,0:12:40.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:44.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a dead man! The fire is all over the place!Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:46.95,Main,,0,0,0,,How could this happen all of the sudden?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.95,0:12:51.28,Main,,0,0,0,,--It's hot! It's hot! --There's no way out!Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.65,0:12:57.72,Main,,0,0,0,,We have to give up!Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:24.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What just happened?Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.51,0:13:27.19,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a path!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.37,0:13:29.85,Main,,0,0,0,,The explosion left a path!Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.85,0:13:31.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on but this is great!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.99,0:13:36.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey look, there is a ship!Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.10,0:13:37.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I see a ship!Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.86,0:13:40.43,Main,,0,0,0,,This path leads up to the shore!Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.43,0:13:42.99,Main,,0,0,0,,We can get away by following it!Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.39,0:13:47.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go before the fire returns!Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.94,0:13:55.21,Main,,0,0,0,,How awful they are to burn the area and the residents there!Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.45,0:13:57.49,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way,Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.49,0:14:02.26,Main,,0,0,0,,how did you know the situation in such an outlying country in the East Blue?Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:06.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Is there something special about this country?Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.32,0:14:10.33,Main,,0,0,0,,This country is an example of how the world will be in the future.Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.57,0:14:16.63,Main,,0,0,0,,No happiness can be found in a country that eliminates people they deem unnecessary.Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:21.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I will change this world someday, I swear it!Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.89,0:14:27.35,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll never be free if I stay here!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.47,0:14:33.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Children are born innocent, even in a country like this.Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.66,0:14:49.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Those who are willing to fight beside me in a battle for freedom...Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:51.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Come aboard my ship!Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.17,0:14:57.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.08,0:14:59.86,Captions,,0,0,0,,Goa KingdomDialogue: 0,0:14:57.08,0:14:59.86,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Royal Palace"Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:10.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Is Edge Town really safe? The flames look like they could consume us at any second!Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:17.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Is there any change at all we could go to High Town?Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.30,0:15:18.65,Main,,0,0,0,,No, there isn't.Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.23,0:15:22.90,Main,,0,0,0,,They don't even allow a bug to enter - nobles only!Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:27.61,Main,,0,0,0,,--Boss! --Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.08,0:15:29.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.81,0:15:31.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:34.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:36.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:40.72,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Ace and Dadan...Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.72,0:15:46.58,Narrator,,0,0,0,,left in the flames of the Gray Terminal, did not return.Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.36,0:15:53.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, now... Wait, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.42,0:15:55.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't try to move in your condition.Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.67,0:15:58.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go look for Ace and Dadan!Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.69,0:16:00.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool!Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:06.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Your wounds are really deep. Now, now, just relax.Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:09.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Right now, the Gray Temrinal is crawling with soldiers cleaning up after the fire.Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:21.23,Main,,0,0,0,,And they're not just burying the burned trash, but any survivors they find as well.Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:23.99,Main,,0,0,0,,If you go there now, you'll get killed.Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.99,0:16:25.53,Main,,0,0,0,,But...!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.84,0:16:38.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna see Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.54,0:16:42.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I know that Sabo is worrying about us, too!Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:47.65,Captions,,0,0,25,,The remains of the Gray TerminalDialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:55.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Our orders are clear, shoot all survivors on sight...Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.31,0:16:56.69,Main,,0,0,0,,As if anyone could survive this!Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.03,0:17:00.05,Main,,0,0,0,,But there aren't as many corpses as I expected...Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.05,0:17:03.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, you saw how fierce the fire was. It must have burned everything, even their bones.Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:11.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I was really worried that the fire would jump the wall and reach the city yesterday...Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.64,0:17:14.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard that Bluejam's ship burned down.Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.38,0:17:18.82,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing those thugs were burned to death, at least.Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.32,0:17:27.39,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times you run, you can't get away, Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.97,0:17:33.03,Main,,0,0,0,,All the police and troops have a picture of you now!Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.03,0:17:36.46,Main,,0,0,0,,You will never get out of High Town...Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:38.07,Main,,0,0,0,,or even out of this house!Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.50,0:17:44.90,Main,,0,0,0,,You two, change your uniforms and start working here as guards.Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:46.98,Main,,0,0,0,,But we have our duties...Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.98,0:17:50.77,Main,,0,0,0,,There is nothing that a nobleman can't do.Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:53.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll get the approval of your superiors.Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.02,0:18:00.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo, you must barricade yourself in your roomDialogue: 0,0:18:00.15,0:18:03.73,Main,,0,0,0,,and educate yourself in your role as a noble!Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.73,0:18:04.71,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.71,0:18:10.54,Main,,0,0,0,,As you know, I can make things happen just by giving the word.Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:14.73,Main,,0,0,0,,So I can take care of you or those two easily.Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.39,0:18:17.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Am I understood?Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.27,0:18:19.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Dad...Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.16,0:18:25.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace... Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.05,0:18:36.33,Main,,0,0,0,,If you understand, then change your ways. Start studying the way Stelly does.Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.33,0:18:43.87,Main,,0,0,0,,And then, study many different things, and make the father and mother who gave you life happy.Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.65,0:18:48.07,Main,,0,0,0,,That is your happiness.Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.07,0:18:50.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you not agree?Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.34,0:18:54.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.92,0:18:58.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! I'm here for you!Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.33,0:19:02.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You're so dependable, Stelly!Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:05.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright! I'll buy you a new marvelous new outfit!Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.62,0:19:07.95,Main,,0,0,0,,The ceremony is in two days, after all.Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.95,0:19:10.84,Main,,0,0,0,,There, we'll see the Celestial Dragon in person!Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:22.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Make sure you have your homework finished by tomorrow.Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.34,0:19:25.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then, have a good day.Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.66,0:19:37.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace... Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.09,0:19:42.06,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way you'd die in a fire like that, right?Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.75,0:19:45.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You're safe, right?Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.87,0:19:59.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I really want to see you...Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.01,0:20:07.79,Main,,0,0,0,,But if I do, I'd only put you in danger again...Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:10.49,Main,,0,0,0,,This place is like a bird cage...Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:16.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if I can bear living in this kingdom, breathing this stale air.Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.21,0:20:25.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Just what... is freedom?Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.64,0:20:28.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Where can I find it?Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.04,0:20:34.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, we're leaving now.Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.70,0:20:37.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Take good care of Sabo.Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.64,0:20:39.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Very well, Master.Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.14,0:21:06.28,Main,,0,0,0,,On this day, one of the World Nobles comes to Goa Kingdom from the Grand Line.Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.56,0:21:12.11,Main,,0,0,0,,A grand ceremony has been prepared to welcome the ship.Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.34,0:21:20.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! Someone's sailing out there!Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.73,0:21:23.33,Main,,0,0,0,,--What? --Is that a fishing boat?Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:30.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Come back here! Don't get in the way of the ceremony!Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.30,0:21:35.81,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a child! There's a child on the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.81,0:21:39.88,Main,,0,0,0,,A child? I wonder which family he's from.Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:41.25,Main,,0,0,0,,A child?Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:45.14,Main,,0,0,0,,The weather's great!Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.14,0:21:46.95,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a perfect day for a voyage!Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.45,0:21:55.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! That's my ship!Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.72,0:21:58.37,Main,,0,0,0,,He stole my fishing boat!Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.37,0:22:01.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! He's flying a black flag!Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.18,0:22:03.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Does he think that he's a pirate?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.77,0:22:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,No way! A kid can't just become a pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.85,0:22:11.18,Main,,0,0,0,,--Where is he heading? --He's disrupting the ceremony.Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.18,0:22:14.38,Main,,0,0,0,,The Government's ship will arrive soon!Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.38,0:22:16.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and do something!Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:17.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.55,0:22:19.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.46,0:22:23.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Kid, come back here now!Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.14,0:22:29.99,Main,,0,0,0,,The thing I'm most afraid of... is being consumed by this country,Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.60,0:22:33.26,Main,,0,0,0,,and becoming a completely different person!Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.75,0:22:38.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm never turning back!Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.02,0:22:45.38,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not Sabo, is it?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.20,0:22:51.34,Main,,0,0,0,,The Government Ship is here!Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.30,0:23:12.24,Main,,0,0,0,,The ship is huge!Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.24,0:23:14.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll die if I crash into it.Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.45,0:23:16.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's avoid that.Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.82,0:23:26.33,Main,,0,0,0,,They're so blessed that it's rare to even see them!Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.33,0:23:30.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that a real Celestial Dragon is on that ship!Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.52,0:23:34.13,Main,,0,0,0,,What is that?Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.86,0:23:37.66,Main,,0,0,0,,That looks like a fish boat.Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.58,0:23:45.43,Main,,0,0,0,,It'd be nice to be captain of a ship like that someday!Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.06,0:24:04.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace is not dead!Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.16,0:24:08.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Easy, easy, I know. I know how you feel.Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.21,0:24:10.86,Main,,0,0,0,,But it's too risky to go to Gray Terminal nowDialogue: 0,0:24:10.86,0:24:13.13,Main,,0,0,0,,since you're wounded and there are troops everywhere!Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.13,0:24:17.71,Main,,0,0,0,,--But...! --It was a big fire! And chances are...Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.14,0:24:23.94,Main,,0,0,0,,...slim but we all want to believe that the boss and Ace are alive.Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.94,0:24:27.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Dogra went there to look for them now so trust him and wait.Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.14,0:24:32.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Everybody's having a hard time - not just you, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.91,0:24:39.26,Main,,0,0,0,,--The fishing boat has been hit! --How's the child?Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.26,0:24:41.89,Main,,0,0,0,,He made the Celestial Dragon mad!Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.24,0:24:43.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.27,0:24:47.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! The ship is catching fire!Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.50,0:24:48.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did they shoot me like that?Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.73,0:24:52.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Saint Jalmack! There is a child on the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.74,0:24:57.24,Main,,0,0,0,,When someone flies a black flag, he's a pirate regardless of who he is.Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.42,0:24:59.81,Main,,0,0,0,,But most importantly...Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.17,0:25:05.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.25,0:25:09.75,Main,,0,0,0,,A commoner shouldn't cross the path of my ship!Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.37,0:25:26.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! What was that ship doing?Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.23,0:25:28.17,Main,,0,0,0,,This is an important ceremony!Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.17,0:25:31.68,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't wanna put the Celestial Dragon in a bad mood!Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.68,0:25:34.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Move the shipwreck already!Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.78,0:25:58.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.07,0:26:00.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone, those two...Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.57,0:26:01.74,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.90,0:26:05.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Those two are back!Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.00,0:26:27.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so relieved!Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.45,0:26:31.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace... Boss...Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.27,0:26:35.24,Main,,0,0,0,,She's severely wounded! Hurry up and treat her!Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.63,0:26:37.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.18,0:26:41.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.58,0:26:42.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.08,0:26:48.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you think that I was dead?Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.15,0:26:50.45,Main,,0,0,0,,--But...! --What're you crying for?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.90,0:26:54.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't act like I'm dead when I'm not, you idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.44,0:26:57.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Easy, easy, that's enough.Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.82,0:26:59.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy is just happy.Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.78,0:27:08.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you about the night of the fire?Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.18,0:27:10.54,Main,,0,0,0,,After we left with Luffy,Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.54,0:27:13.66,Main,,0,0,0,,what happened to you and boss?Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.30,0:27:18.15,Main,,0,0,0,,After you left, we fought Bluejam...Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.23,0:27:22.20,Main,,0,0,0,,We managed to defeat him somehow...Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.71,0:27:28.92,Main,,0,0,0,,And then we tried to catch up with you guys as fast as we could...Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.72,0:27:32.08,Main,,0,0,0,,But by that time, the path had already been blocked.Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.70,0:27:35.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Dadan suffered horrible burns.Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.35,0:27:39.47,Main,,0,0,0,,We found a hiding spot where the fire wouldn't reach us, by the river in the Middle Forest.Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.22,0:27:49.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I went into the city in order to steal medicine, and get some food.Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.17,0:27:53.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Then I tried desperately to keep Dadan alive.Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.89,0:28:01.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, now, so that's what happened?Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.91,0:28:05.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad you both made it out alive.Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.29,0:28:07.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I made you worry.Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.96,0:28:11.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I never thought something like this could happen to the Gray Terminal...Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.86,0:28:13.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Sabo is worried.Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.38,0:28:21.61,Main,,0,0,0,,More insolent commoners might show up.Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.61,0:28:24.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Be sure to be on the lookout.Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.08,0:28:24.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Sir!Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.95,0:28:32.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder what Sabo's up to...Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.67,0:28:37.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm glad Ace came back, and Dadan is getting better.Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.60,0:28:41.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace, back then...Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.90,0:28:43.21,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.21,0:28:44.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,will not run away!Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.81,0:28:47.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you run?Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.08,0:28:51.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, my blood just starts rushing to my head...Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.52,0:28:56.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel like, if I run, I'll lose something important.Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.22,0:28:57.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Back then...Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.60,0:29:02.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy was right behind me.Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.71,0:29:05.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure, but I think that's why.Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.79,0:29:12.95,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Even when he was up against a huge army and had no chance of winning...Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.23,0:29:16.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger stood his ground, he never ran away.Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.91,0:29:19.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Did he want to die or something? Fleeing is a way to fight as well.Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.97,0:29:21.92,Main,,0,0,0,,True, but he never ran.Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.92,0:29:25.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Because the people he held dear were behind him.Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.81,0:29:29.69,Main,,0,0,0,,If they ran away together, his crewmates' lives would be in danger too.Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.69,0:29:33.66,Main,,0,0,0,,To be precise, it's not that he never ran away...Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.66,0:29:38.18,Main,,0,0,0,,but rather, he didn't want the enemy to go after his crew. So he never let the enemy get away.Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.18,0:29:41.69,Main,,0,0,0,,When he was like that, Roger truly was a demon.Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.69,0:29:46.19,Main,,0,0,0,,There were times when he annihilated entire armies, just because they spoke badly of his crew.Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.80,0:29:51.02,Main,,0,0,0,,True, if you made him mad, he was brutal, short-tempered and selfish...Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.02,0:29:56.67,Main,,0,0,0,,However, those actions were always as simple and honest as those of a child.Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.67,0:29:59.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he grew up similar to how Ace is now.Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.78,0:30:04.13,Main,,0,0,0,,He truly hated the thought of losing his loved ones.Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.41,0:30:13.34,Main,,0,0,0,,It was his reckless lifestyle, and the luck that kept him alive, that made him the Pirate King.Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.31,0:30:19.71,Main,,0,0,0,,He had an awful reputation around the world, but the trust he earned from his crew was immeasurable.Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.71,0:30:24.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though I'm a marine, I could never bring myself to hate him.Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.33,0:30:28.31,Main,,0,0,0,,That is why I decided to take care of Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.31,0:30:30.36,Main,,0,0,0,,We're the ones taking care of him!Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.36,0:30:33.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?! It sounds like you've got a problem with that.Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.15,0:30:34.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh, no, none at all.Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.96,0:30:39.75,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Roger is still despised by society to this day...Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.75,0:30:45.00,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I guess that even if Ace despises his father, he still carries his blood.Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.00,0:30:48.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright... Who's gonna win?Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.84,0:30:50.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Dogra!Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.56,0:30:54.70,Main,,0,0,0,,You went looking for Ace and Dadan, right?Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.70,0:30:56.26,Main,,0,0,0,,They've both come home!Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.06,0:31:01.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Really, they have? That's great...Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.63,0:31:03.53,Main,,0,0,0,,W-What?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.53,0:31:04.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo is...Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.86,0:31:07.44,Main,,0,0,0,,You liar!Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.81,0:31:09.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't even joke about that!Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.78,0:31:10.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.94,0:31:13.73,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not a lie, nor a joke!Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.73,0:31:17.74,Main,,0,0,0,,It was so sudden, I barely realized what had happened. I doubted my own eyes!Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.74,0:31:20.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I wondered if it was just a dream or an illusion!Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.87,0:31:24.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Sabo went back to his noble born parents!Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.47,0:31:26.79,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way he'd sail out to sea!Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.79,0:31:28.85,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! Sabo went home...Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.85,0:31:32.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Outlaws like us understand how he must have felt...Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.07,0:31:34.57,Main,,0,0,0,,We all have places we really don't want to go back to!Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.71,0:31:41.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you really think he'd go to sea... if he was actually happy?Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.18,0:31:46.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you really think he'd fly a pirate flag and set out on his own?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.41,0:31:57.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo...Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.53,0:32:01.28,Main,,0,0,0,,He really wasn't happy!Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.10,0:32:06.49,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Even with parents, I'm still alone!Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.49,0:32:11.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Why... Why didn't we try to break him out of there?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.02,0:32:16.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is the person who killed Sabo?! I'm gonna murder him!Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.60,0:32:19.39,Main,,0,0,0,,T-The Celestial Dragon?! There's no way you can do th-Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.39,0:32:21.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna avenge his death!Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.05,0:32:22.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.59,0:32:25.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Drop it, you damn brat!Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.83,0:32:27.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Get off me...Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.35,0:32:28.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way!Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.89,0:32:32.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You keep acting tough, even though you don't have any real strength!Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.36,0:32:36.69,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you can do now?! You'll just end up dead!Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.69,0:32:41.85,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll die, and everyone will forget you by tomorrow! That's all you amount to right now!Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.67,0:32:47.41,Main,,0,0,0,,It was this kingdom that killed Sabo! It was the world itself!Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.41,0:32:49.84,Main,,0,0,0,,What can you do?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.99,0:32:53.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Your father's death brought about a new era!Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.88,0:32:59.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Once you become a man of his caliber, then you're free to live or die as you want!Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.51,0:33:04.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Go tie up this moron!Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.89,0:33:04.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh, right... Go tie up this moron!Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.91,0:33:06.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh, right...Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.58,0:33:10.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.70,0:33:11.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it!Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.87,0:33:18.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Men aren't supposed to be sobbing like that, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.46,0:33:37.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you calmed down a little, Ace?Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.28,0:33:42.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Untie him.Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.78,0:33:43.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Right.Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.97,0:33:46.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll loosen these right away.Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.90,0:33:48.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.01,0:33:50.58,Main,,0,0,0,,He cried all night. He's asleep now.Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.91,0:33:54.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss! You have to see this!Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.93,0:33:57.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I-It's a letter! From Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.06,0:34:00.65,Main,,0,0,0,,"To my brothers at Mt. Corvo - Sabo"Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.77,0:34:00.65,Main,,0,0,0,,He sent a letter before setting out to sea!Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.98,0:34:03.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me that.Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.17,0:34:07.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I swear I won't go into the city. That letter is addressed to us, right?Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.59,0:34:18.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace, Luffy. I hope you weren't hurt in the fire.Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.09,0:34:20.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm worried, but I believe that you're safe.Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.52,0:34:27.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about this, but by the time you read this letter, I'll be...Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.24,0:34:30.09,Main,,0,0,0,,out at sea.Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.27,0:34:35.05,Main,,0,0,0,,A lot has happened, and I've decided to set sail ahead of you guys.Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.59,0:34:44.55,Main,,0,0,0,,My destination won't be in this country, but elsewhere.Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.64,0:34:47.98,Main,,0,0,0,,There, I will become stronger...Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.62,0:34:50.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll become a pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.81,0:34:57.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's become pirates with more freedom than anyone else, and meet up again someday. The three of us.Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.22,0:35:03.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Somewhere out on the wide, free ocean... I'm sure that someday, we'll meet!Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.06,0:35:07.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, and Ace...Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.25,0:35:11.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder who's the older brother between the two of us?Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.28,0:35:15.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Two eldest sons, and one younger brother...Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.76,0:35:20.73,Main,,0,0,0,,It might be strange, but this bond between us is my treasure.Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.06,0:35:30.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy might still be a weakling and a crybaby...Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.34,0:35:40.44,Main,,0,0,0,,but he's our brother! Take care of him for me!Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:06.49,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing SewilDialogue: 0,0:00:06.49,0:00:09.22,Credits,,0,0,0,,Timing SewilDialogue: 0,0:00:09.22,0:00:11.76,Credits,,0,0,0,,Karaoke KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:14.66,Credits,,0,0,0,,QC Galaxy 9000 Pepperjack Danpmss DolphinWeabuDialogue: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:16.76,Credits,,0,0,0,,Translation Crunchyroll Funimation YibisDialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:18.50,Credits,,0,0,0,,Raws df68Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:22.47,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:22.47,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:18.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,YoDialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:19.24,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:19.24,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:22.65,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:22.65,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:18.92,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ruDialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:19.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:19.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:22.77,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:22.77,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:19.04,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gaDialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:19.54,Karao